<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Mills raised to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Mills raised to hold.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg analyst Chris Jakubik said Friday he raised his rating on General Mills Inc to hold from sell.</p>
<p>-- Jakubik said he believed General Mills' dividend yield would support the stock in the low $60-a-share range.</p>
<p>-- His earnings estimate remains $3.20 a share for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- General Mills shares were up 11/16 at 65-11/16.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
